    "Scan of the 1949 edition of the Beaufort, North Carolina, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the Department of Commerce. Surveyed in 1947; aerial photographs from 1980; field checked in 1949; photo revised in 1983; last revised in 1983; printed in 1984.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 27 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
